SUMMARY:Classy Cocktails at Top of the Monk for the last Summer Soiree! 
 😄
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n🍸 **Classy Cocktails: Rooftop Sips at T
 op of the Monk**\n\n📅 **Thursday\, Sept 10th**\n**⏰ 6:30 to 8:30 PM**
 \n**📍 Top of the Monk\, 92 Patton Ave\, Asheville**\n\nSummer is starti
 ng to wind down\, so it seems like the perfect excuse to take Classy Cockt
 ails upstairs\, grab a great drink\, enjoy a warm September evening on a r
 ooftop\, and hang out with some of our favorite people.\n\nThis time we're
  heading to Top of the Monk\, downtown Asheville's oldest cocktail bar and
  one of those places that feels distinctly Asheville.\n\nTucked above the 
 former Thirsty Monk (now Crowbar)\, Top of the Monk is an intimate cocktai
 l lounge with a rooftop patio overlooking downtown and the Blue Ridge Moun
 tains. And these folks take their cocktails seriously. They use fresh ingr
 edients and make their own bitters\, tinctures\, infusions\, syrups and sh
 rubs in-house.\n\nIf whiskey is more your thing\, you're in good hands the
 re too. They have an impressive whiskey collection and bartenders who actu
 ally know what they're pouring.\n\nAnd then there's the quirky little Top 
 of the Monk tradition. Order a cocktail and you may receive a small key th
 at unlocks one of their old post-office-box-style snack cubbies. You'll ju
 st have to come see what that's all about. 😉\n\n**What to Expect**\n**
 🍸** Really good handcrafted cocktails\n🥃 Plenty of options for the w
 hiskey lovers\n🌄 Rooftop views over downtown and toward the mountains\n
 ☀️ One more gorgeous summer evening outside\n😂 Easy conversation\, 
 laughs and the usual Classy Cocktails crew\n😊 New faces are always welc
 ome\n\nWe're keeping this one simple. Good people. Good drinks. A rooftop.
  A late-summer evening. Nowhere else you need to be for a couple of hours.
 \n\n**Parking**\nThere are several paid parking lots around Top of the Mon
 k\, including parking directly behind it. The parking structure behind it\
 , however\, is only $1 an hour\, so you shouldn't have to sacrifice your c
 ocktail budget just to park your car. 😉\n\nCome quench your thirst as w
 e squeeze one more rooftop Classy Cocktails evening out of the summer. See
  you at the Top! 🍸🌄
