SUMMARY:Asheville Foodie Supper Club
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n🍝 Asheville Foodie Supper Club: First S
 top\, Italia! 🇮🇹\n\nSunday\, September 27 | 6:00 to 9:00 PM\nStrada 
 Italiano | 27 Broadway\, Downtown Asheville\n\nLimited to 12 people\n\nI
 ’ve been wanting to create something a little different for Asheville Di
 gital Nomads\, something smaller\, more intimate\, and centered around one
  of my very favorite ways to bring people together. Food. 😁\n\nSo\, I
 ’m officially launching the Asheville Foodie Supper Club\, a monthly cul
 inary adventure where a small group of us will gather around a table\, exp
 lore Asheville’s ridiculously good food scene\, and actually have time t
 o get to know one another.\n\nWe’re kicking this thing off with Italian.
  🇮🇹🍝🍷\n\nOur first stop is Strada Italiano in downtown Ashevil
 le\, a cozy Old World-style trattoria serving regional Italian cuisine ins
 pired by both Northern and Southern Italy. Think house-made pasta\, risott
 o\, seafood\, Italian classics\, good wine\, and the kind of food that mak
 es you very happy you did not stay home and eat something responsible. 
 😆\n\nEach month\, we’ll choose a different foodie theme. Italian one 
 month\, Korean another\, Thai\, Indian\, Mexican\, burgers\, pizza\, seafo
 od\, Mediterranean\, tapas\, and whatever other interesting culinary rabbi
 t holes we decide to wander down.\n\nBut the food is only half the idea. T
 he real purpose of the Asheville Foodie Supper Club is to create a differe
 nt kind of social experience.\n\nInstead of standing around at a larger ev
 ent having snippets of conversations with 20 different people\, we’ll si
 t around one table with just 8 to 12 of us. We’ll eat. We’ll talk. We
 ’ll laugh. We’ll hear each other’s stories. We’ll linger over dinn
 er and hopefully turn some of those people we recognize from Meetup into p
 eople we actually know.\n\nThe intention of this event is to meet interest
 ing people\, discover really good food and local restaurants\, and enjoy c
 onversations that have enough time to go somewhere.\n\n🍷 A Little Suppe
 r Club Fine Print\n\nThis event is intentionally limited to 12 people\, an
 d unlike some of our larger gatherings\, this one requires an actual resta
 urant reservation.\n\nSo please only RSVP if you genuinely intend to come.
  Don’t grab one of the 12 seats as a “maybe.” If something changes\,
  no problem\, just update your RSVP as soon as possible so someone on the 
 waitlist has a chance to join us.\n\nBecause when there are only 12 chairs
  at the table\, every chair matters.\n\nStrada also offers a nice range of
  gluten-free\, vegetarian\, vegan and dairy-free options\, so our first Fo
 odie adventure should have something for just about everyone.\n\nCome hung
 ry and ready to connect with some fun and friendly new humans over a yummy
  meal together.\n\nWelcome to the Asheville Foodie Supper Club. First stop
 \, Italy. 🇮🇹 🍝🍷🍽️
